# The fetched Open-i archive: 1.4 GB, and not ours to redistribute wholesale.
# The exception is the 95 films the G1 gold set actually names (17 MB, added
# with `git add -f`, so they stay tracked despite this rule). Without them a
# fresh checkout -- which is what CI is -- resolves every gold case to zero
# images, and G1 reports `critical_recall: None`. That is the eval behaving
# correctly: a case it could not run is not evidence of anything. It also
# means the hard gate could never go green on CI, so it graded nothing on
# every merge. Films are cheaper to commit than a gate nobody can run.
data/openi/
*.tgz
outputs/

# medscope.store.SqliteRunStore's default location -- a runtime artifact
# (persisted workbench runs), not a fixture.
data/runs.sqlite3
